{"articleNo":"80847","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=80847&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"한국품질재단 \"2013 이공계 전문기술 연수사업\" [자동차분야 생산/품질관리 실무] 연수생 모집안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.04.01","hit":"4863","attachments":[{"name":"2013년 이공계 전문기술연수사업 참가신청서 및 자기소개서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=80847&attachNo=71529"},{"name":"이공계연수생모집 브로셔.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=80847&attachNo=71810"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>사업명</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년도 이공계 전문기술연수사업 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">과정명 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자동차분야 생산</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">품질관리 실무</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]<br><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">■&nbsp;<strong>연수목적</strong></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 이공계 대졸자에게 정부지원으로 직무능력향상 및 현장체험 교육을 실시하여 연수생의 취업지원 및<br></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 기업의 수요에 부합하는 우수 산업기술인력 양성<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br>■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>연수기간</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 04. 22 ~ 2013. 10. 10 (36</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) [</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">약 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">비합숙</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br>■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>연수장소</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국품질재단 대구</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">경북지역본부<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대구광역시 달서구 갈산동 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">971-2 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대구비즈니스센터 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">801</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br>■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>지원자격 <br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이공계 대졸</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전문대졸</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대학원졸 포함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">미취업자로서 만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">32</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">세</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1981.1.1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이후출 생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이하인자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지원제외대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">정부 실업대책 지원금 수혜 중인 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">동 사업에 참여하여 연수수당을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">회 이상 지급받은 자 또는<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;참여 중인 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대학원 재학 중인 자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">우대대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장애자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기초생활수급자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">보훈대상자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월이상 장기실업자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">여성 인력<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br>■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>연수생 특전<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수강료 무료<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연수수당지급 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개인당 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">220</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만원 지급 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전문연수 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">30</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기업연수 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">50</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전문자격증 취득기회</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">시그마 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">GB, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자동차분야 개발전문가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">공정관리전문가 등 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">종</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연수기간 중 조기 취업 지원<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br>■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>연수프로그램</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-far